WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.957
Views are useful security-adjacent interfaces, but they should not be described as secure or compliant simply because

00:00:06.957 --> 00:00:09.334
they hide columns.

00:00:09.914 --> 00:00:14.108
Permissions still matter. Row-level security may matter.

00:00:14.108 --> 00:00:20.882
Application access paths matter. Compliance depends on a broader system of controls.

00:00:20.882 --> 00:00:24.661
Keep the claim proportional to what the view actually does.
